Another strategy (which I have successfully employed) is to get Master
Kaen to follow you up the stairs, and then teleport to the next up
staircase. When Kaen is critically wounded, he teleports to the up
staircase so he can easily escape should you pursue him. The only
problem with his strategy is that you're standing on them! If you don't
have controlled teleportitis, you'll have to walk to the up staircase,
which can be a very risky venture. Master Kaen will repeatedly attack
you. You can't really attack him back either (unless you're
incapacitating him) because then he'll just teleport to the staircase.

